He drags it out and then goes, 'It's
Kuro-chan.'

00:35:56.557 --> 00:35:58.697
Yeah, that was infuriating.

00:35:58.717 --> 00:36:02.478
But at least that let us see how the
connections work.

00:36:02.498 --> 00:36:07.099
Once the Saraba guys got free, things
spread really fast from there.

00:36:07.099 --> 00:36:08.099
Yeah, they really did.

00:36:08.159 --> 00:36:10.760
So now it's just how far the two from
Saraba can go.

00:36:10.940 --> 00:36:16.021
Right. At this point it all depends on how
many allies Saraba can rescue.

00:36:16.021 --> 00:36:17.450
Right. But we're out of money now.

00:36:17.641 --> 00:36:20.202
Yeah. Human nature really comes out in
moments like this.

00:36:20.202 --> 00:36:21.202
It comes out, it comes out, it comes out.

00:36:21.362 --> 00:36:25.663
The kind of person who won't hand over
money there, the kind of person who won't say his savings balance there...

00:36:26.043 --> 00:36:28.544
Even in an extreme situation, it still
comes out.

00:36:28.544 --> 00:36:29.304
It comes out.

00:36:29.304 --> 00:36:32.004
Ah, but yeah, I really do hate Kuro-chan
the most.

00:36:32.004 --> 00:36:32.864
Hate him.

00:36:32.864 --> 00:36:33.745
Seriously.

00:36:33.745 --> 00:36:35.545
After all that, I actually thought, 'I
hope he drowns out there.'

00:36:35.545 --> 00:36:36.185
Hahaha.
